# Admin UI (jsonConfig)

## Files

- `admin/jsonConfig.json` — UI definition (source of truth for labels/help)
- `admin/i18n/de.json`, `admin/i18n/en.json` — **manually maintained only**
- All other languages (`es`, `fr`, `it`, `nl`, `pl`, `pt`, `ru`, `uk`, `zh-cn`) — generated by owner via `npm run translate`; do **not** edit manually

## jsonConfig guidelines

- End-user friendly labels; sensible defaults; validation on required fields
- Every jsonConfig field must exist in `io-package.json` → `native` with a default
- Sensitive fields (`influx_token`): use `password` type; keep in `protectedNative` / `encryptedNative`
- Use `hidden` conditions for fields that depend on other options (e.g. `enpal_url` when `wallbox_enabled` is off)

## Translations workflow

When changing `admin/jsonConfig.json`:

1. Add new keys to `admin/i18n/de.json` (German) and `admin/i18n/en.json` (English)
2. Remove orphaned keys from `de.json` and `en.json` when keys are removed from jsonConfig
3. Keys must match jsonConfig exactly
4. Do **not** run `npm run translate` — owner runs it before release

## Config fields

### InfluxDB

- `influx_url` (text): InfluxDB base URL (default `http://localhost:8086`)
- `influx_token` (password): InfluxDB API token
- `influx_org` (text): InfluxDB organization ID
- `influx_bucket` (text): InfluxDB bucket name
- `interval_s` (number): poll interval in seconds (min 5, default 60)
- `show_sync_info` (checkbox): log successful syncs as `info` messages

### Wallbox control (optional)

- `wallbox_enabled` (checkbox): enable wallbox control via Enpal Box web interface
- `enpal_url` (text): Enpal Box base URL (e.g. `http://192.168.x.x`); shown only when `wallbox_enabled` is true
